function appendStarweaveEvent(event,live){var session=selectedStarSession();if(!session||!event||event.groupId!==session.groupId||event.sessionId!==session.sessionId)return false;if(live&&Number(event.generation)!==Number(session.generation))return false;if(event.eventSeq<=starSessions.lastSeq)return false;if(event.type==='USER_MESSAGE_ACCEPTED')confirmChatMessage((event.payload||{}).messageId);starSessions.events.push(event);starSessions.lastSeq=event.eventSeq;if(live&&(event.type==='TURN_COMPLETED'||event.type==='TURN_ERROR'))setTimeout(function(){loadStarweaveSessions(false)},0);return true}
async function loadStarweaveSnapshot(){var session=selectedStarSession();if(activePage!=='sessions'||!session||starSessions.transitioning||!session.sessionId)return;var version=starSessions.transitionId,key=session.groupId+'|'+session.sessionId+'|'+session.generation,token=++starSessions.snapshotToken;starSessions.polling=true;try{var response=await api('/api/starweave/v1/sessions/events?groupId='+encodeURIComponent(session.groupId)+'&sessionId='+encodeURIComponent(session.sessionId)+'&after=0');var result=await response.json();if(token!==starSessions.snapshotToken||version!==starSessions.transitionId||starSessions.transitioning)return;if(!response.ok||result.accepted===false)throw new Error(result.message||'历史加载失败');if(key!==(selectedStarSession()&&selectedStarSession().groupId+'|'+selectedStarSession().sessionId+'|'+selectedStarSession().generation))return;starSessions.events=[];starSessions.lastSeq=0;var events=(result.data&&result.data.events)||[];events.forEach(function(e){appendStarweaveEvent(e,false)});renderStarweaveEvents();connectStarweaveStream()}catch(e){if(token===starSessions.snapshotToken&&version===starSessions.transitionId&&!starSessions.transitioning)showSnackbar('会话历史加载失败: '+e.message)}finally{if(token===starSessions.snapshotToken)starSessions.polling=false}}
function connectStarweaveStream(){var session=selectedStarSession();if(activePage!=='sessions'||!session||starSessions.transitioning||!session.sessionId)return;var key=session.groupId+'|'+session.sessionId+'|'+session.generation;if(starSessions.stream&&starSessions.streamKey===key)return;closeStarweaveStream();var url='/api/starweave/v1/sessions/stream?groupId='+encodeURIComponent(session.groupId)+'&sessionId='+encodeURIComponent(session.sessionId)+'&generation='+encodeURIComponent(session.generation)+'&after='+encodeURIComponent(starSessions.lastSeq);if(curInstance&&curInstance.instanceId)url+='&instance='+encodeURIComponent(curInstance.instanceId);var stream=new EventSource(url);starSessions.stream=stream;starSessions.streamKey=key;stream.addEventListener('starweave',function(message){if(starSessions.stream!==stream||starSessions.streamKey!==key||starSessions.transitioning)return;try{var event=JSON.parse(message.data);if(appendStarweaveEvent(event,true))scheduleStarweaveEventsRender()}catch(e){}});stream.addEventListener('RESYNC_REQUIRED',function(){if(starSessions.stream!==stream||starSessions.transitioning)return;closeStarweaveStream();starSessions.events=[];starSessions.lastSeq=0;loadStarweaveSnapshot()});stream.onerror=function(){if(activePage!=='sessions'||starSessions.streamKey!==key)closeStarweaveStream()}}
function renderStarweaveUploads(){var box=document.getElementById('starUploadList');if(!box)return;box.innerHTML=starSessions.uploads.map(function(upload,index){var state=upload.error?'error':(upload.uploadId?'ready':'uploading'),status=upload.error?' · '+esc(upload.error):(upload.uploadId?' · 已就绪':' · 上传中');return '<span class="session-upload-chip '+state+'"><span class="material-icons" style="font-size:15px">'+(upload.error?'error_outline':(upload.uploadId?'description':'hourglass_top'))+'</span>'+esc(upload.fileName)+status+'<button onclick="removeStarweaveUpload('+index+')" title="移除"><span class="material-icons" style="font-size:15px">close</span></button></span>'}).join('')}
